				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;The Company may enter into discussions and agreements with individuals, agencies and/or governmental authorities under which it is reimbursed in cash for qualifying costs incurred to relocate pipeline assets as a result of public infrastructure projects. The Company recognizes the full cost of these relocation activities as incurred in the reimbursable project expense account within the other current assets financial statement line item on the balance sheet. These &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;reimbursements represent recovery of costs required to be incurred due to the nature of the projects and are not recognized as revenue or other income. Any items not reimbursed would be expensed as operations and maintenance in the consolidated statement of income and retained earnings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:8pt; line-height:108%; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;ol start="7" type="a" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:10pt; text-indent:-18pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic; list-style-position:inside; -aw-list-padding-sml:12.06pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span style="font:7pt 'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Property, Plant and Equipment&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-inside:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;Property, plant, and equipment are stated at cost, including direct labor incurred in connection with the construction of pipeline assets. Retirements and sales of property, plant and equipment are charged to accumulated depreciation as prescribed by FERC. Depreciation is calculated using the straight-line method at rates approved by FERC. These rates range from 2.25% to 20.00% per annum. &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;ol start="8" type="a" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:10pt; text-indent:-18pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic; list-style-position:inside; -aw-list-padding-sml:12.61pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span style="font:7pt 'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Leases&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;The Company recognizes operating lease right-of-use assets and operating lease liabilities on the consolidated balance sheet for operating leases with a term greater than 12 months. Certain practical expedients were utilized, along with the transition package of practical expedients, and accounting policy decisions made when the leasing standard was previously adopted, which included: (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;) short-term lease recognition exemption, (ii) not evaluating existing or expired land easements that were not previously accounted for as leases under the previous lease guidance, (iii) initial indirect cost reassessment exemption, (iv) legacy lease classification reassessment exemption, and (v) accounting for certain asset classes at a portfolio level by not separating the lease and non-lease components and accounting for the agreement as a single lease component. The Company elected to use hindsight whe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;n determining the lease term.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;The Company determines whether a contract is or contains a lease at inception of the contract, based on answers to a series of questions that address whether an identified asset exists and whether the Company has the right to obtain substantially all of the benefit of the asset and to control its use over the full term of the agreement. Such contracts include new or amended agreements for land easements subsequent to the initial adoption of ASC 842, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; font-style:italic"&gt;Leases.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; font-style:italic"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;ol start="9" type="a" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:10pt; text-indent:-18pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic; list-style-position:inside; -aw-list-padding-sml:16.49pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span style="font:7pt 'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Other Noncurrent Assets&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
