			&lt;ol start="12" type="a" style="margin:0pt; padding-left:0pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;li style="margin-top:12pt; margin-left:18pt; margin-bottom:10pt; text-indent:-18pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic; list-style-position:inside; -aw-list-padding-sml:16.49pt"&gt;&#xD;
					&lt;span style="font:7pt 'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Revenue&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;The majority of the Company&amp;#x2019;s service-based revenue is derived from tariff-based transportation services that the Company provides to its customers. A performance obligation is a promise in a contract to transfer goods or services to the customer. The contract transaction price is allocated to each performance obligation and recognized as revenue when, or as, the performance obligation is satisfied. &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;The Company&amp;#x2019;s transportation revenues derived from its affiliates were 7% for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024. The Company had 52 and 50 non-affiliate customers in 2025 and 2024, respectively. Ten significant non-affiliate customers accounted for 72% and 73% of transportation revenue in 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;Transportation r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;evenue from pipeline operations is comprised of tariffs associated with the transportation of liquid petroleum products, generally at published tariff rates, and in certain instances, revenue from committed capacity contracts at negotiated rates. Tariff revenue is recognized at the point of delivery pursuant to specifications outlined in the respective tariffs. Our tariffs generally include product loss allowance factors intended to, among other things, compensate for losses due to evaporation, measurement &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;tolerances, interface downgrades and other product losses in transit, which is recorded as allowance oil revenue. All of the Company&amp;#x2019;s transportation contracts have a single performance obligation to provide pipeline transportation service, and the performance obligation is satisfied at a point in time as transportation services are delivered. Services are typically billed on a bimonthly basis, and the Company generally does not offer extended payment terms. In addition, certain agreements require counterpa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;rties to throughput a minimum volume over an agreed-upon period. Revenue pursuant to such agreements is recognized when the volume is throughput or if the Company determines that the customer is not expected to meet its volume commitment at the end of the contract.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;Blending revenue is derived from the blending of butane into liquid petroleum products. Revenue is recognized at a point in time upon completion of the blending cycle. All of the Company&amp;#x2019;s blending contracts have a single performance obligation to provide pipeline transportation service for the blended product.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;Storage revenue represents the revenue earned from certain contracts the Company has entered into with various shippers for the use of the Company&amp;#x2019;s storage tanks along the pipeline. Generally, shippers are billed a flat rate per month, which vary based on the contract with the shipper and is recognized as revenue monthly.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;The timing of revenue recognition, billings, and performance of an obligation may differ from the timing the associated consideration is paid or received from the customer, resulting in the recognition of account receivables, a contract asset or contract liability. The Company recognizes a contract liability if the customer&amp;#x2019;s payment of consideration precedes the Company&amp;#x2019;s fulfillment of the performance obligation. &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;The following table provides information about the opening and closing balances of contract balances from contracts with customers as of December 31: &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
