			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; text-align:justify; page-break-inside:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;Accrued benefit cost is reflected in other current and other non-current liabilities on the consolidated balance sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; text-align:justify; page-break-inside:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;Accumulated other comprehensive (income)/loss is $126,312 and $797,482 related to the plans at December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. This change is primarily comprised of actuarial and investment activity, net of income taxes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; background-color:#ffff00"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; text-align:justify; page-break-inside:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;The accumulated benefit obligation for the pension plan was $28,720,702 and $29,401,415 at December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
