			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-inside:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-inside:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;The Company also has a contributory thrift plan which is available to substantially all employees. The Company matches employee contributions up to 6% of the employee&amp;#x2019;s base salary. In addition, a separate 401(k) plan went into effect January&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;1, 2007 for all employees hired subsequently. Total contributions by the Company to the two plans were $3,277,595 and $3,076,968 for 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:20pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial; font-weight:bold"&gt;8 - COMMITMENTS AND CONTINGENCIES&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-inside:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;The Company has entered into both cancelable and non-cancelable agreements for pipeline right-of-way. All right-of-way agreements are future commitments since they relate to the operation of the pipeline and are necessary for its continued operation. These right-of-way agreements do not meet the definition of a lease due to the right-of-way agreements not conveying substantially all of the economic benefits from using the land for the term of the contract.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:10pt; page-break-inside:avoid; font-size:10pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;The following is a schedule by year of minimum future rentals on right-of-way commitments as of December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Arial"&gt;31, 2025:&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
